  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAs">III As</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="1" corresp="#wit-q">Et hoc incepimus quantum diligentius potuimus, auxilio (consilio) sapientum eorum, quos ad nos misisti.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#attenborough" n="1" corresp="#wit-q">Et hoc incepimus quanta diligentia potuimus, auxilio sapientum eorum quos ad nos misisti.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-q">And this we have undertaken , with all the zeal of which we are capable, and with the help of the councillors whom you have sent to us.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Latin only; no German translation in Liebermann.</note>
      </div>
